c_pair":0,"lift":0.93,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:212-the-hedge-mustard":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: The Hedge-Mustard","headword":"The Hedge-Mustard","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"Mars owns this herb also. It is singularly good in all the diseases of the chest and lungs, hoarseness of voice: and by the use of the decoction thereof for a little space, those have been recovered who had utterly lost their voice, and almost their spirits also. The juice thereof made into a syrup, or licking medicine, with honey or sugar, is no less effectual for the same purpose, and for all other coughs, wheezing, and shortness of breath. The same is also profitable for those that have the jaundice, pleurisy, pains in the back and loins, and for torments in the belly, or cholic, being also used in clysters. The seed is held to be a special remedy against poison and venom. It is singularly good for the sciatica, and in joint-aches, ulcers, and cankers in the mouth, throat, or behind the ears, and no less for the hardness and swelling of the testicles, or of women’s breasts.","spans":[{"start":92,"end":102,"concept_id":"sore_throat","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":215,"end":231,"concept_id":"sore_throat","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":404,"end":410,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":412,"end":420,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":426,"end":445,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":499,"end":507,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":509,"end":517,"concept_id":"pleurisy_pneumonia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":556,"end":577,"concept_id":"colic","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":582,"end":588,"concept_id":"colic","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":667,"end":673,"concept_id":"poisoning","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":678,"end":683,"concept_id":"poisoning","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":715,"end":723,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":732,"end":743,"concept_id":"joint_pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":745,"end":751,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":757,"end":777,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":[]}